    "question": {
      ":question/id": "16232e37-1f42-5954-acad-51650972d2a3",
      ":question/problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/repairs/2026-10-19-checkbox-nonempty/baseline-samples/17592186096700/assets/a4a9712f25a9bc89cda7837037e1051513ca8b0d10a6bd40989c18c69f0078ac.png)\n\nConsider the diagram that is shown above. Which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $s=3t$\n\nII. $r=2p$\n\nIII. $q=-r$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- Statement I is false. The vectors $s$ and $t$ are parallel and have the same direction. The magnitude of $s$ is $1$ times the magnitude of $t$. So, $s\\ne 3t$.\n\n- Statement II is true. The vectors $r$ and $p$ are parallel and have the same direction. The magnitude of $r$ is $2$ times the magnitude of $p$. So, $r=2p$.\n\n- Statement III is true. The vectors $q$ and $r$ are parallel and have opposite directions. The magnitude of $q$ is $1$ times the magnitude of $r$. So, $q=-r$.\n\nTherefore, only statements II and III are true.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "269bd06a-bff8-50a4-af25-385f71a8c18b",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "25e40039-cae7-5d15-a8b5-4e4b2cf0b004",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "95c15832-67bb-5b50-9516-f161bae9216f",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "6d7de38d-891f-5a7c-ae7e-aa8334589ba0",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "f2b98f4a-072d-547f-b328-bfe59e9ceff0",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "bd21dbbf-00a4-5869-8f56-ed31b43274b0",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II only"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "25e40039-cae7-5d15-a8b5-4e4b2cf0b004"
          ]
        }
      ],
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate"
    },
